Note on the data

The MIT license above covers the code, documentation and generated figures and
tables in this repository. It does not cover the underlying field-trial data,
which is not distributed here.

That data is deposited at Data Dryad under doi:10.5061/dryad.p30c6 by
C. S. Wortmann, A. R. Dobermann, R. B. Ferguson, G. W. Hergert, C. A. Shapiro,
D. D. Tarkalson and D. T. Walters, and is released under CC0 1.0 Universal, a
public-domain dedication. CC0 imposes no conditions on reuse, but the deposit
should still be cited when the analysis is reported, as it is in README.md.
